			</dict>
			<dict>
				<key>Comment</key>
				<string>SSDT-AWAC - insurance for the Q270 legacy RTC/AWAC clock (official sample SSDT-AWAC-DISABLE). If the machine hangs or misbehaves at early boot, disable this entry first.</string>
				<key>Enabled</key>
