		<dict>
			<key>PciRoot(0x0)/Pci(0x1f,0x3)</key>
			<dict>
				<key>#NOTE</key>
				<string>ALC294 layout-id 12 (authored by MacPeet for Lenovo M710Q, same Tiny platform; verified working on the M910Q EFI). The alcid=12 boot-arg below carries the same value as the robust primary path (Q270 HDAS sits at Pci(0x1f,0x3), not the Kaby-era 0x1b,0x0 used by the repos). Fallbacks if no audio: alcid=11, 13, 21, 15 (change BOTH this layout-id and the boot-arg).</string>
				<key>hda-gfx</key>
				<string>onboard-1</string>
				<key>layout-id</key>
				<integer>12</integer>
			</dict>
			<key>PciRoot(0x0)/Pci(0x2,0x0)</key>
			<dict>
				<key>#NOTE-1</key>
				<string>[2026-11-14 MEASURED] UHD 630 native device-id 0x3E9B CONFIRMED WORKING: this QQLT drives a display over DP (H27T22 27-inch) in Windows. The "no-display ES" risk from v1 is resolved; no device-id spoof. DISPLAY CONNECTOR MAPPING STILL MUST BE CALIBRATED ON THE REAL MACHINE WITH HACKINTOOL. This config follows the M910Q repo + Dortania Coffee Lake desktop guide: platform-id 07009B3E drives displays from the UHD 630. The P320 Tiny has DP (x2) + optional HDMI; the M910Q EFI only patched con2 to HDMI (type 0x10) and left con0/con1 native - the same placeholder is used below.</string>
				<key>#NOTE-2</key>
				<string>IF YOU GET A BLACK SCREEN ON FIRST BOOT: (1) try the other physical video port first, (2) unplug one display output and boot with a single DP cable, (3) if still black, add boot-arg igfxonln=1, (4) then re-map connectors with Hackintool and write real framebuffer-conX-* values here.</string>
				<key>#device-id</key>
				<string>NOT SET on purpose. [2026-11-14 MEASURED] QQLT UHD 630 native device-id 0x3E9B confirmed working over DP - no spoof needed. The M910Q repo spoofed device-id 923E0000 (0x3E92) for its 8700T ES - only add device-id=&lt;923E0000&gt; here as a fallback if the framebuffer misbehaves (black screen after the OpenCore picker).</string>
				<key>AAPL,ig-platform-id</key>
				<data>
				BwCbPg==
				</data>
				<key>framebuffer-con2-enable</key>
				<data>
				AQAAAA==
				</data>
				<key>framebuffer-con2-type</key>
				<data>
				EAAAAA==
				</data>
				<key>framebuffer-patch-enable</key>
				<data>
				AQAAAA==
				</data>
				<key>framebuffer-unifiedmem</key>
				<data>
				AAAAgA==
				</data>
				<key>hda-gfx</key>
				<string>onboard-1</string>
				<key>model</key>
				<string>Intel UHD Graphics 630</string>
			</dict>
